list_children: <List> renders only its `row` snippet; put the row content in `{#snippet row(item, index)}` (use {#each} for ordinary children of a container)
  App.svelte:11:19: list_prop_invalid: <List> `layout` must be one of `list`, `grid`, got `table`
  App.svelte:11:34: list_prop_invalid: <List> `selection` must be one of `none`, `single`, got `multiple`
  App.svelte:11:55: list_bind_invalid: <List> has no bindable `x`: only `bind:selected` (the selected position) and `bind:this` (for `scrollTo`)
  App.svelte:12:17: list_row_params: the `row` snippet of a virtualized list takes at most `(item, index)`
  App.svelte:13:10: list_row_toplevel: <window> is a toplevel on gtk; a row of a virtualized list is content inside the list (a <box> per row)
